# Unity 资源以文本形式存盘，统一 LF，避免换行反复变动
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cs text diff=csharp
*.json text
*.md text
*.asset text
*.prefab text
*.unity text
*.mat text
*.meta text
*.asmdef text
*.txt text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.psd binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.otf binary
*.ttf binary
*.fbx binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
